# Option B (DECISIONS 2026-08-27): only ~150 event pages are prerendered. A direct hit
# or hard refresh on any other /event/<id> has no static file, so serve the SPA shell
# (200.html) with a 200 and let the client render it from the event's fetched slice.
# Prerendered event pages are real static files and take precedence over this rule.
/event/* /200.html 200
